# What docker/Dockerfile's `COPY . .` must not take in: host builds (a stale target/ could shadow the
# binary this build makes), the Git metadata nothing reads, and the build's own output. out/ would
# change the context between the binary and the sbom exports and cost a second native compile.
target/
**/target/
.git
out/
# The VHS tapes, their text goldens and their GIFs (epic qits-881): the build reads none of them, and
# the GIFs would only make every context upload larger.
tapes/
